<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Your Zero Waste Account Is Ready</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: #f4f6f8;
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;
      color: #333333;
    }
    .wrapper {
      max-width: 580px;
      margin: 40px auto;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 10px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    }
    .header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #16a34a 0%, #15803d 100%);
      padding: 36px 40px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 26px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    }
    .header p {
      margin: 6px 0 0;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .body {
      padding: 36px 40px;
    }
    .body p {
      margin: 0 0 16px;
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #555555;
    }
    .credentials-box {
      background-color: #f0fdf4;
      border: 1px solid #bbf7d0;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 20px 24px;
      margin: 24px 0;
    }
    .credentials-box .label {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.8px;
      color: #16a34a;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }
    .credentials-box .value {
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #111827;
      word-break: break-all;
    }
    .credentials-box .divider {
      border: none;
      border-top: 1px solid #d1fae5;
      margin: 14px 0;
    }
    .cta-btn {
      display: block;
      width: fit-content;
      margin: 28px auto 0;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #16a34a 0%, #15803d 100%);
      color: #ffffff !important;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 14px 36px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.3px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .warning {
      background-color: #fffbeb;
      border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b;
      border-radius: 4px;
      padding: 14px 18px;
      margin-top: 28px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #78350f;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
    .footer {
      padding: 20px 40px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #9ca3af;
      border-top: 1px solid #f3f4f6;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>♻️ Zero Waste Platform</h1>
      <p>Your account has been created by an administrator</p>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <p>Hello <strong>{{displayName}}</strong>,</p>
      <p>
        An administrator has created a <strong>{{role}}</strong> account for you on the Zero Waste platform.
        Use the credentials below to sign in and get started.
      </p>

      <div class="credentials-box">
        <div class="label">Email Address</div>
        <div class="value">{{email}}</div>
        <hr class="divider" />
        <div class="label">Temporary Password</div>
        <div class="value">{{plainPassword}}</div>
      </div>

      <a href="{{loginUrl}}" class="cta-btn">Sign In to Your Account →</a>

      <div class="warning">
        ⚠️ <strong>Important:</strong> This password was auto-generated. Please change it immediately after your first login to keep your account secure.
      </div>

      <p style="margin-top: 24px;">
        If you have any questions, please reach out to the platform administrator.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      © {{year}} Zero Waste Platform. All rights reserved.<br/>
      This email was sent because an administrator created an account using your email address.
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
